{{ 'hooks-pages.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

<section class="hooks-page hooks-about-page">
  <div class="hooks-page-hero">
    <img
      src="{{ 'hooks-about-hero-final.png' | asset_url }}"
      alt=""
      width="2048"
      height="1024"
      loading="eager"
      class="hooks-page-hero__image"
    >
    <div class="page-width hooks-page-hero__inner">
      <p class="hooks-page-eyebrow">About HooksLB</p>
      <h1 class="hooks-page-title">Comfort, without the bulk.</h1>
      <div class="hooks-page-lead">
        <p>HooksLB brings a simpler approach to the everyday belt—secure, adjustable, and comfortably buckle-free.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="hooks-about-content">
    <div class="page-width">
      <div class="hooks-about-story">
        <h2>A small change that makes everyday dressing easier.</h2>
        <div class="hooks-about-story__text rte">
          <p>Traditional buckles can feel bulky, press against the waist, and interrupt the clean line of an outfit. Hooks offers a different solution: a flexible belt that attaches to the side loops and keeps the front free.</p>
          <p>Our focus is straightforward—offer a useful product, make ordering simple, and deliver across Lebanon with the convenience of cash on delivery.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hooks-values">
        <article class="hooks-value-card">
          <span class="hooks-value-card__number">01</span>
          <h3>Simple by design</h3>
          <p>One useful product with a clear purpose: everyday comfort without a front buckle.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="hooks-value-card">
          <span class="hooks-value-card__number">02</span>
          <h3>Made for everyday wear</h3>
          <p>Flexible and adjustable, so it can move with you throughout the day.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="hooks-value-card">
          <span class="hooks-value-card__number">03</span>
          <h3>Easy to order</h3>
          <p>Delivery across Lebanon with the convenience of cash on delivery.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="hooks-page-cta">
    <div class="page-width">
      <h2>Ready to meet your new everyday belt?</h2>
      <a class="button" href="/#hooks-featured-product">Shop Hooks</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
